ARIA Alembic — async-DBAPI migrations for ARIA's own database.

Tables managed here:
  - amenities, bookings, community_events, dues, community_notices, rsvps
    (society domain — moved from t2t_backend during the T2T extraction)
  - rag_chunks (RAG chunks with optional pgvector)
  - llm_calls (LLM call metrics)

Run:
    cd communityos-aria
    alembic upgrade head
